#@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
#@type = "sites"

Feature: Site Landing Pages
	API testing for checking site landing pages

Setup:
	* I get all site URLs

Scenario: Okta Site
    Okta Site should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${oktaURL}" page

Scenario: RabbitMQ Site
    RabbitMQ Site should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${rabbitmqURL}" page

Scenario: Customer Site
    Customer Site should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${customerURL}" page

Scenario: Koroneiki Site
    Koroneiki Site should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${koroneikiURL}" page

Scenario: Provisioning Site
    Provisioning Site should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${provisioningURL}" page

Scenario: Zendesk Site
    Zendesk Site should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${zendeskURL}" page

Scenario: Issues Zen Site
    Issues Zen should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${issuesZenURL}" page